---
// Static, presentational block – no logic inside (per user rules)
---

<section id="mini-case-studies" class="px-4 py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl">
    <div class="mb-10 flex items-end justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">Case studies</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 hidden text-justify text-muted-foreground md:block">
          With our Development Hour Packs, you get a reliable and flexible way to scale your tech capacity without the
          headaches of hiring full-time staff. Whether you need extra help for a specific project, ongoing support for
          multiple clients, or the ability to quickly scale your development power, our hour packs give your agency the
          freedom to grow with confidence.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 block text-muted-foreground md:hidden">
          With our Development Hour Packs, you get a reliable and flexible way to scale your tech capacity without the
          headaches of hiring full-time staff.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <article
        class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-gradient-card p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/20 hover:shadow-glow"
      >
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between">
          <!-- <img src="/brands/dislicores-logo.png" alt="Client logo" class="h-8 w-auto opacity-90" loading="lazy" /> -->
          <div class="rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-primary">Automation</div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">
          Automation that saved a marketing agency 60 hours per month.
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          We integrated ops tooling, pipelines, and alerts across their stack.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-secondary/30 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-foreground">
            <span class="font-semibold text-accent">60+</span> hrs/month saved
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-secondary/30 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-foreground">
            <span class="font-semibold text-accent">3</span> teams unblocked
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/20 to-accent/20 blur-2xl transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"
        >
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <article
        class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-gradient-card p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/20 hover:shadow-glow"
      >
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between">
          <!-- <img src="/brands/laucorporativa-logo.avif" alt="Client logo" class="h-8 w-auto opacity-90" loading="lazy" /> -->
          <div class="rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-primary">Product</div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">
          We launched an MVP in 8 days to validate an idea and secure investment.
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Tight scope, robust architecture, and a demo-ready UI.</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-secondary/30 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-foreground">
            <span class="font-semibold text-accent">8</span> days to MVP
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-secondary/30 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-foreground">
            <span class="font-semibold text-accent"><span class="sr-only">Investment</span>🎯</span> investor-ready
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/20 to-accent/20 blur-2xl transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"
        >
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <article
        class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-gradient-card p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/20 hover:shadow-glow"
      >
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between">
          <!-- <img src="/brands/mapei-logo.avif" alt="Client logo" class="h-8 w-auto opacity-90" loading="lazy" /> -->
          <div class="rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-primary">Migration</div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">
          We migrated a Shopify store with zero downtime and a 32% increase in conversion.
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          Seamless data transfer, performance tuning, and A/B driven UX changes.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-secondary/30 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-foreground">
            <span class="font-semibold text-accent">0</span> downtime
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-secondary/30 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-foreground">
            <span class="font-semibold text-accent">+32%</span> conversion
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/20 to-accent/20 blur-2xl transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"
        >
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
